  "sourceTitle": "Night School Pisco Sour",
  "sourceText": "Night School Pisco Sour\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Tuesday, February 23, 2010 - 1:31pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 ounces Encanto Acholado Pisco\n1 ounce Fresh Lemon-Lime Juice\n1 egg white\n3/4 ounce Sugar Syrup\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Shake ridiculously long and hard, then strain into a bucket with a bit of ice, and garnish with a dash of Angostura bitters.\n\nAbout\n\n\nRecipe prepared by Neyah White and Duggan McDonell at Drinking Lessons at the Sorrento Hotel on Feb 21st and 22nd.",
  "parsedSource": {
    "ingredients": [
      {
        "sourceText": "2 ounces Encanto Acholado Pisco"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1 ounce Fresh Lemon-Lime Juice"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "1 egg white"
      },
